Modifications (2026-11-11, fork v5):
- src/lib.rs: get_manga_list browse URL changed from the site's retired
  10-segment filter format to the current 12-segment format
  ({order}_{tagid}_{isfull}_{anime}_{rgroupid}_{sortid}_{update}_{quality}_{page}_{typeid}_{pubtime}_{inmatch});
  the template is the site's own themes/mobile/js/AsideFilter.js
  generateFilterUrl, verified against live filter pages the same day.
  typeid/pubtime/inmatch have no Aidoku filter in this source and stay "0".
- src/lib.rs: FILTER_TAGID gains "66" (site added tag 青春, tagid 66).
- res/filters.json: 作品主題 gains "青春" as the last option (tagid 66).
- res/source.json: version 4 -> 5.
- Cargo.toml: package renamed aidoku-bilicomic -> bilicomic so the built
  wasm is bilicomic.wasm (same convention as the registry's other sources);
  dependencies unchanged from upstream.
- res/settings.json: new empty array. Upstream ships no settings file; the
  empty file exists only so package.py validates the same res/ set as the
  registry's other sources. It exposes no settings.
No other upstream file was changed. Search is intentionally unchanged: the
site's search endpoints return HTTP 200 with an empty body and no alternative
search API exists (see NOTES).
